      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bu-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(2) This subsection applies if:  (a) any fee (the reasonable fee):  (i) that has been determined under subsection 56BV(1) for the person; or  (ii) that can be worked out from a method determined under subsection 56BV(1) for the person;  covers either or both of the matters in paragraph (1)(c) of this section; and  (b) the portion of the fee charged as described in that paragraph for those matters exceeds the corresponding portion of the reasonable fee.",
