      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person commits an offence if the person holds out that the person:  (a) is an accredited person; or (b) is an accredited person holding an accreditation that has been granted at a particular level (see paragraph 56BH(1)(d)); or (c) is an accredited data recipient of CDR data;"
    },
